 "traps": [
  "docker-compose.yaml starts only PostgreSQL; every other service is a production environment variable read in config/runtime.exs",
  "package files go to several S3 buckets through ex_aws_s3, documentation jobs come from SQS through broadway_sqs, and private docs live in Google Cloud Storage (the \"gcs,\" prefix)",
  "there is no package.json: Tailwind CSS and esbuild are Mix packages that download their binaries in dev",
  "GitHub is the OAuth login (ueberauth_github), and OpenID Connect (oidcc) verifies workload identity tokens for publishing",
  "Varsel is the external service that receives package security reports; Hex billing is a separate service reached through HEXPM_BILLING_URL",
  "ExUnit ships with Elixir and has no dependency line; GeoIP reads a local MaxMind file and is not a service",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
